[01:00.76] Shimmering snow covers a path we all fear
[01:06.60] But this time there's no turning back
[01:10.52] To say my goodbyes, if only within my own heart
[01:16.58] As life starts to spill from my eyes
[01:20.49] Soul parts with flesh, it watches a shell marching on
[01:26.46] As ice underneath starts to crack
[01:30.13] No panic or dread, slowly I sink 'neath the waves
[01:36.33] Forever embracing the fathomless black
[01:40.64] And one winter day it all seemed to finally break
[02:26.47] Revealing a sonorous truth
[02:29.75] I never had known such sadness could live in us all
[02:35.99] It stands with no chance to elude
[02:40.08] Only when you're at your lowest, shattered
[02:45.03] Frantically searching with no one to reach
[02:49.56] You'll learn the true meaning of silence
[02:54.90] Bereft of the credulous hopes, yet finally free
[03:00.63] 